TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution, 100 C, pe 4, pH 5

SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -tol 1e-12
        -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kin.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true

END
